        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7dbd419f-4d8e-33f9-a86b-70a6b52f2912",
                "word": "indûment",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0048cd55-fdb4-4807-add4-f4a7ad9b82c9",
                        "entry_id": "7dbd419f-4d8e-33f9-a86b-70a6b52f2912",
                        "tags": [
                            "orthographe rectifiée de 1990"
                        ],
                        "form": "indument"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a3142526-d710-3c73-913c-db889f03814b",
                        "entry_id": "7dbd419f-4d8e-33f9-a86b-70a6b52f2912",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une manière indue, injustement."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c27172a1-0f8c-47f9-a8e0-093a962b8acf",
                                "sense_id": "a3142526-d710-3c73-913c-db889f03814b",
                                "text": "Inversement, le signalement intervient quelquefois pour prouver la non identité, à la requête de personnes honorables […], qui demandent que l’on efface de leur casier des condamnations indûment inscrites."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f96788f-fd13-4df2-871c-770c3e8155a6",
                                "sense_id": "a3142526-d710-3c73-913c-db889f03814b",
                                "text": "Oui, sans doute, il est pitoyable que des personnes aisées occupent indûment des lits dans les hôpitaux."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "73501bb4-f18a-4e5b-95dc-1904533afb3e",
                                "sense_id": "a3142526-d710-3c73-913c-db889f03814b",
                                "text": "Les opposants au concept de genre prétendent souvent avancer des arguments relevant des sciences biologiques pour appuyer leurs propos. Ils construisent leur discours sur une supposée différence essentielle entre hommes et femmes, qui viendrait fonder un ordre décrit comme « naturel ». Les éléments de biologie sur lesquels ils s'appuient sont cependant, dans la plupart des cas, sortis de leur contexte et indûment généralisés."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b9feca5e-bc92-45c9-a31d-399d4ff57966",
                        "source_entry_id": "7dbd419f-4d8e-33f9-a86b-70a6b52f2912",
                        "source_sense_id": "a3142526-d710-3c73-913c-db889f03814b",
                        "source_sense_description": "D’une manière indue",
                        "target_lang_word": "unangemessen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unangemessen",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48ef691a-aab7-38d9-b7e3-d166ba64be96",
                                        "entry_id": "1c2ef383-98ea-30fa-aef2-0896e2c6635e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nicht angemessen, nicht passend für die Umstände"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dc143e4-fbef-4b72-a3be-0e042bbd2508",
                                                "sense_id": "48ef691a-aab7-38d9-b7e3-d166ba64be96",
                                                "text": "Ihr Betragen war äußerst unangemessen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "92d4f0fb-8a41-45a6-ac33-22540f421810",
                        "source_entry_id": "7dbd419f-4d8e-33f9-a86b-70a6b52f2912",
                        "source_sense_id": "a3142526-d710-3c73-913c-db889f03814b",
                        "source_sense_description": "D’une manière indue",
                        "target_lang_word": "unduly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unduly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62006b65-771d-3958-986a-45abc9c35bef",
                                        "entry_id": "9808fef1-e8d9-3303-aab6-da8ca683cb8c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Undeservedly; in a way that is not warranted."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70a08ef8-43fd-490d-b61f-6b7f3d884f1b",
                                                "sense_id": "62006b65-771d-3958-986a-45abc9c35bef",
                                                "text": "The speaker unduly criticized his opponent and later apologized for this."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "233b0880-9bf1-4797-bc22-46af2c026e58",
                                                "sense_id": "62006b65-771d-3958-986a-45abc9c35bef",
                                                "text": "The departure was not unduly prolonged. In the road Mr. Love and the driver favoured the company with a brief chanty running. “Got it?—No, I ain't, 'old on,—Got it? Got it?—No, 'old on sir.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7e3a865-c325-4e28-86d8-727e64fc8fc1",
                                                "sense_id": "62006b65-771d-3958-986a-45abc9c35bef",
                                                "text": "No. 4 has recently undergone complete overhaul to relieve Dolgoch of much of the heavy work, but No. 3 has proved unduly sensitive to permanent way defects and is not to be used in regular service until further track improvements are carried out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8728cd4b-3601-4369-b7ff-6dc2217ceb7e",
                                                "sense_id": "62006b65-771d-3958-986a-45abc9c35bef",
                                                "text": "It was a casual sneer, obviously one of a long line. There was hatred behind it, but of a quiet, chronic type, nothing new or unduly virulent, and he was taken aback by the flicker of amazed incredulity that passed over the younger man's ravaged face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f2ec84a5-fb61-47c2-9d48-d812cc5be6d7",
                        "source_entry_id": "7dbd419f-4d8e-33f9-a86b-70a6b52f2912",
